#: ../../source/users/folio/what_is.rst:5
msgid "What is a folio?"
msgstr "什么是阴茎?"

#: ../../source/users/folio/what_is.rst:7
msgid ""
"A `folio`_ is part of the `project`_ that can be considered as a unit. It "
"can be the `project index`_, part of the `schema`_, the part list complete "
"or partly, etc."
msgstr ""
"A`图幅 <folio_>`_ 是可视为单位的 `项目 <project_>`_ 的一部分，可以是 `项目指数 <project "
"index_>`_，`schema <schema_>`_ 的一部分，该部分列表完整或部分等。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/what_is.rst:10
msgid ""
"The `folio`_ defines the maximum part of the project information that can be"
" displayed at the same time in the `workspace`_, a `folio`_ from a "
"`project`_ is equivalent to a page of a book. When a `project`_ is exported "
"to PDF, each `folio`_ is one page from the document. When a `project`_ is "
"exported to any other format (PNG, JPG, DXF, etc.), each `folio`_ is one "
"file."
msgstr ""
"`图幅 <folio_>`_ 定义了项目信息中可以同时在 `工作区 <workspace_>`_ 中显示的最大部分，一个 `图幅 <folio_>`_ "
"的 `项目 <project_>`_ 相当于一页书页，当一个 `项目 <project_>`_ 输出到PDF时，每个 `图幅 <folio_>`_ "
"是文档中的一页，当一个 `项目 <project_>`_ 输出到任何其他格式(PNG,JPG,DXF等)时，每个 `图幅 <folio_>`_ "
"是一个文件。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/what_is.rst:15
msgid ""
"Inside a `project`_, the `folios`_ should have an order. For an easy "
"understanding of the `schema`_, it is important that the user takes care "
"about the position and information that is included at each `folio`_."
msgstr ""
"内置 a `项目 <project_>`_，则 `图幅 <folios_>`_ 应该有一个命令。 `计划 "
"<schema_>`_，用户必须注意每个用户所包括的位置和信息。 `图幅 <folio_>`_。"

#: ../../source/users/folio/what_is.rst:21
msgid "Figure: QElectroTech folios"
msgstr "图：QElectroTech光圈"
